  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Transicion Energetica Justa En Guinea Ecuatorial</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">The project aims to address the severe socio-economic disparities in the rural areas of Punta Mbonda and Akurenam-Esacora by providing reliable solarpowered electricity and supporting agricultural value addition. The project will establish solar mini-grids and solar-powered food processing units, enabling better food preservation, reduced post-harvest losses, and increased income through value-added agricultural products.</narrative>
  </description>
